_3D.ShowMaterialFlowDirection [SimTalk]
Shows the material flow direction arrow of the length-oriented object designated by <Path> (true) along
the insertion direction or hides it (false).
Remarks
_3D.ShowMaterialFlowDirection only applies to simulation objects and animatable objects which are
length-oriented and which have a meaningful material flow direction.
As the FootPath does not have a meaningful material flow direction, it does not show the direction arrow
despite being length-oriented.
